  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Variant_Chiseled_Bookshelves/BH_Variant_Chiseled_Bookshelves_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">透過「多樣化雕紋書架」模組，解鎖古老知識的秘密，並提升您的圖書館美學。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">這個迷人的Minecraft擴展引入了一系列優雅的書架，每種設計都與遊戲經典的木質風格相輔相成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">沉浸於橡木、樺木、雲杉木、叢林木、相思木、黑橡木、緋紅木、竹木、紅樹林木、櫻花木和扭曲木書架的豐富紋理與色調中。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">無論您是在擴展附魔室，還是打造一個舒適的閱讀角落，「多樣化雕紋書架」都能兼顧功能性與美觀性。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">透過這個迷人的模組，探索客製化書籍儲存的美麗！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UHsUm3.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">「多樣化雕紋書架」為每種原版木板類型新增了一個雕紋書架。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">所有紋理皆經過壓縮（不影響品質），以確保模組檔案大小最小化。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">所有紋理均使用相應木板的十六進位顏色手動創建，確保外觀正確。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">若遇到任何問題，所有變體均可還原為原版樣式。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">原版書架已更名為橡木書架，並稍作重新上色，以更貼合橡木類型。</span></li></ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L0Hhc5C.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"315\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Rexus2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rexus</a> 在其模組系列中介紹</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FtNaXEcHBGc?clip=UgkxED3N_Zq2LbpUU6Ti2_VdtVBZj8N6Q6f5&amp;clipt=EPjoAhij6AM\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><h6><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UHsUm3.png\"></span></h6><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><table style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMxYXtMz5r\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=452161&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"208\" height=\"50\"></a></span></td><td><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/xanthian\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=452161&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\"></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fxanthian\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Variant_Crafting/BH_VC_BisectPromo.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"80\"></a></p>",
